            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "Which sensors out of these benefit from the 64-bit support?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "64Bit sensors support doesn't exist in CX devices and it's verified with CPU. But on alon8 verified the existing sensors and all looks intact."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi, do you also have a plan to update pldmtool?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "Its pushed already - https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/84672"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you. I will review it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 224,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "presentReading is 32 bits, so you can't use decode_numeric_sensor_data"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 224,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "He seems to have a patch to cast 64b-long data to 32b in libpldm https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/libpldm/+/84665.\n\nAre we planning on changing the decode_numeric_sensor_data function to support an uint64_t presentReading?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 224,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "Added the new API decode_numeric_sensor_data_ex for supporting 64 Bit in libpldm https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/libpldm/+/84665 and used it in pldm. \n\n/oem/amphere/ also has reference to decode_numeric_sensor_data.  You would like to update @chaul@amperecomputing.com depending on need?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 224,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for addressing my comments. I left some comments on your patch.\nAnd yes, I will send a patch to update oem/ampere when we have the decode function merged to libpldm."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 254,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "Are these static_casts per type are actually necessary? What was wrong with the previous code?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 254,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "@deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com - You are reviewing the old patchset. This code moved to new commit. https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/85940/2/platform-mc/event_manager.cpp  Can you please review new and add your comments on it?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 258,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "What was the behavior without this case for 64 bit sensors? I ask because you anyway read the value as a double below."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 258,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "New API added in LibPLDM for event data decode. can you review this: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/85940/2/platform-mc/event_manager.cpp"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/event_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 266,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
